# Standardized ART framework script. Frame is fixed; test logic is filled per step.
#
# ==== OBJECTIVE — expected results this script must demonstrate ====
#   - Dynamic ARP entries removed from the ARP cache on a clear-all request, with static
#   entries retained.
#   - A single dynamic entry removed when cleared by its IP address, all other cache entries
#   left intact.
